1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
就是由 AFM 所計算出來的一個一個 V-speed

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:11,000
那是一個呃...

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
就是說他用數學算出來的一個最保守的一個一個安全數,一個一個 Event Speed

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:25,000
就是發生 Event。那這個是還沒有加入 In-service Allowance 的部分

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
好,那剛剛的那一個...

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
我們的 Lift-off speed 是 1.1 倍的 V-mu All-engine Operating

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:43,000
然後是 One-engine Inoperative 是 1.05

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
好,然後再來就是 Minimum Control Speed with critical engine inoperative

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
那這邊可以基本上它...你們小飛機的 Vmc 就是 Vmca

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
對,OK。好,你們沒有 Vmcg

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:07,000
原因是因為呃,Certification 沒有 Requirement,對

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:13,000
好,那 Minimum Stall Speed 是你們都已經知道,Rotation Speed

13
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:19,000
然後 V1 是 Max speed during the takeoff when the pilot must take the first action to stop

14
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:27,000
within the accelerate-stop distance, such as applying brakes or reducing the thrust

15
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Also the minimum speed follow a failure of critical engine at Vef

16
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:42,000
at which the pilot can continue the takeoff and achieve the required height

17
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:47,000
above the takeoff surface within the takeoff distance

18
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:54,000
那 V2 是 Takeoff Safety Speed

19
00:01:54,000 --> 00:02:00,000
那 the target speed that allows for the optimum climb

20
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:05,000
V2 min 是 Minimum Takeoff Safety Speed 最低的

21
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,000
那 Vso 是 Stall speed or minimum steady flight speed in landing configuration

22
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:15,000
Vs1 是 for... the stall speed obtained in a specified configuration

23
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:19,000
所以你可以有 Flap 1 的 Vs1,你也可以有 Flap Up 的

24
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:26,000
那個什麼,Vs1,對,OK 嗎?

25
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:32,000
好,那一般來講我們的 Vs1 是指定 Configuration 的,一般,對

26
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:39,000
好,那 Vmca 是 Minimum Control Speed in Air,好

27
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:45,000
那這個通常我們在記 Vmca 的時候就是什麼,Rudder Pedal 不超過多少磅,150 磅

28
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Maximum Bank Angle 允許值是多少? 5 度,最大的 Bank Angle

29
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:57,000
然後,但是,然後再來就是 Maintain Directional Control, Heading Change 不可以超過幾度? 20 度

30
00:02:57,000 --> 00:03:03,000
好,對

31
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Vx 是 Best Angle Climb, Vy 是 Best Rate Climb

32
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:12,000
那 Vref 是 Reference speed for the landing

33
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:17,000
target speed for final approach which adjusts the normal approach speed for factors

34
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:22,000
好,那 Vsse, Engine-out inoperative,好

35
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:26,000
大概是這幾個。好,那接下來我們就要談論到...

36
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:32,000
Reference Speed, Reference Speed 的部分

37
00:03:32,000 --> 00:04:30,000
(操作電腦搜尋中,無語音)

38
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:38,000
好,那我們接下來看的是,剛剛我們 Takeoff speed 大致都看完了

39
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:45,000
那我們接下來看 Landing speed 的部分, AIM

40
00:04:45,000 --> 00:05:08,000
(翻閱 AIM 手冊中,無語音)

41
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:14,000
好,我們現在講在 Approach 的部分,在 FAA 如果你們有照這個 Instrument Commercial 的話

42
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:21,000
雖然我之前說不用背,但是如果有的話,你可以 Refer 到 Approach 的部分

43
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:28,000
在第八章吧

44
00:05:28,000 --> 00:07:07,000
(翻閱文件內容,背景雜音)

45
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:15,000
好,我們現在講在 Approach 的部分,在 FAA...

46
00:07:15,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Aircraft Approach Categories: A grouping of aircraft based on a speed of 1.3 times the stall speed

47
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:29,000
in the landing configuration at maximum gross landing weight

48
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:35,000
Category A: Speed less than 91 knots

49
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:40,000
Category B: 91 knots or more but less than 121 knots

50
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:45,000
Category C: 121 knots or more but less than 141 knots
